  "description": "Standard-style attitude indicator: blue sky and brown ground; outer ring with bank marks (10, 20, 30, 45, 60 degrees) that turns with bank under a fixed yellow pointer; inner ball that also moves with pitch (3 px per degree), with a numbered pitch ladder; yellow miniature airplane that the knobs move up and down (attitude bars).",
